{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "cdc2a977a410a9abd6182ae786ba5d5fcdd6881a9aa0758aee8eea98a5623823", "ja": "トークイベント　直前", "zh": "座谈会　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4000_place", "source_sha256": "75f29b8098eea923aa47f8847499566ef39e5af52d5063768dba204fb2e5c699", "ja": "舞台袖", "zh": "舞台侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9489e4d185001ecc95dc895ea0787b45b19fea0df55b5f3f72565f89236f31e5", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっといいですか？\n今日のトークショーのことなんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，可以打扰一下吗？\n有关于今天的座谈会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3a778b76677aa6f6fdb745fc258eabd330616848a0aaba8d7a32698e21a51b80", "ja": "どんな事を話したらいいか、なかなか決まらなくて。\nどうしましょう？", "zh": "我一直无法决定自己该说些什么才好。\n请问要怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4003_p", "source_sha256": "ba7605fd0f094007782923adc84a57f707bdd224c14b929503da30eaccc2c974", "ja": "トークの内容か。\nこのイベントのテーマはなんだったかな？", "zh": "谈话的内容啊。\n这场活动的主题是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8ca7a7772fd1741d72c6865dbdd3945c34fb62cf8047e37271e5927f8ac4a4ed", "ja": "えっと、『なりたい自分になっちゃおう！』です。", "zh": "呃……是『成为理想的自己吧！』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4005_p", "source_sha256": "328c7aed9d6480e7178c26d65d7daf69c23b138c38bae7ee5b2af4d9b9b0730c", "ja": "そうか。さすが転職情報誌主催のトークショー。\nテーマも実に前向きだ……。", "zh": "这样啊，不愧是转职情报志主办的座谈会，\n连主题也很积极正面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3e98a6764b3c182ca0f2587c657df7d19c2a94c6f77ef57bd92940f0961639a5", "ja": "あの、私、なにを話したらいいと思いますか？", "zh": "请问，你觉得我该说什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4007", "source_sha256": "779376bc265beaf54f7a14ff1e66ec97ff211ee3f3eeed66a38af25f8063751f", "ja": "未来の自分の話", "zh": "关于未来的自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4008", "source_sha256": "d9fd409295c787f605751f05e797448d5310bf4cf5a3a9d4ed73cc09a511901f", "ja": "アイドルの話", "zh": "关于偶像", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4009", "source_sha256": "4d9e0d888663bb22fc0f7e09a3be8b6c8a01040151988cb776c16d470a075895", "ja": "遺跡発掘スタッフの話", "zh": "关于考古人员", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4100_p", "source_sha256": "7abe3756f5304be47ede59fb38a0fc86f784c94ac46c7b0eb2400c28ae0fa47a", "ja": "目標はいつだって未来にある。雪歩も、未来の自分は\nこうなっていたいって話をしたらいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "人的目标一直都存在于未来。\n雪步也说说自己未来想变成什么样子就行了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4101_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5c6d75204a578c3d67a879837ea331a254d839695e9e28825f395022cb116f01", "ja": "未来の自分……。まだ、しっかりした形があるわけじゃ\nないですけど、こうだったらいいなっていうのは……。", "zh": "未来的自己……我还没有很清晰的想像，\n但是有想过大致的方向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4102_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c264d996a90f66a2a42bda6249707eb6c9a1c8f613968cb3106fb83c93b68ee", "ja": "私、もしかしたらお話しできることがあるかもです。\nえへへ、ありがとうございますぅ！", "zh": "这个话题我说不定能够发挥呢。\n嘿嘿，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4200_p", "source_sha256": "0b7eeca93f5d0b766aaade7487a45fdcff0e894822952524445cd8b8a9ff5589", "ja": "雪歩は今、なりたかったアイドルになれてるじゃ\nないか。アイドルの話でいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "雪步现在不是已经当上梦想中的偶像了吗？\n那么就聊聊偶像的事情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4201_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0f651f3991b3570c7eac460a096de78d12804163611e1f2a662cd4d494124a52", "ja": "そんな、私なんかまだまだ、ダメダメで……。\nあ、でも、今までの活動のことなら少しは……。", "zh": "怎么会，我还差得远呢，还很不行不行……\n啊，可是，我或许可以聊聊至今的活动经历……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4300_p", "source_sha256": "bb03607a62ef4dc3bd63d1ffb4b52474000e5a55141d0a6188719098b9805ea1", "ja": "遺跡発掘調査のスタッフの話とか、どうかな。", "zh": "说说考古调查人员的话题如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_4301_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6078b5cbcb67fe73831b14c8690e9a7ceca013de7d72fec3265d4bdc11f2ac61", "ja": "わ、私、そんなこと、\n一度も考えたことすらありませんよ……？", "zh": "我、我从来没有想过\n那种事情喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
